Comment: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.66,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ending
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,Signs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:17.61,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway... just don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:20.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:38.34,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:40.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:46.36,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave the window open like that, you'll catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:54.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:00:58.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's rather cold outside, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.71,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, February has only begun, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:12.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which, at the convenience store, I saw a ton of magazines featuring chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:17.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I bet eating chocolate would warm you right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's because it's almost Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:24.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Valentine's Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:03.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:13.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,February 14 is Valentine's Day, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:15.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:19.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it! A Valentine's party here at Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.35,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why at the nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can't hold Valentine's parties at nurseries?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:29.93,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they do in some places, but in Japan, \NValentine's Day is a day for giving chocolate, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:33.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right! That's what was written in the magazines!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:34.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So let's do that here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:36.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Will the girls give it to the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:38.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:44.74,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Valentine's Day is a day where girls give chocolate to the guys they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:48.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What? So that's the purpose of Valentine's Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:50.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's supposedly the opposite nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:54.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You really don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To the person they like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:06.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try holding a Valentine's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:15.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, Miss Sayaka's been looking worried again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:22.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like she's having a really difficult time, but she's trying so hard to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:31.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I thought that a Valentine's party \Nmight cheer her up, even a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:41.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We just don't have the money for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:47.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,W-We can get supplies from Tirol!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:50.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I went there this morning and asked them if I could have some ingredients!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:53.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They said it's fine as long as we work for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.27,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:05:00.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So you're saying that in exchange for helping out at Tirol,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:05.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,the nursery will be able to get supplies for making chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:14.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Did I... do something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:18.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's really busy at work, so it might be hard for me to help out at Tirol...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:21.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I've also taken on some late night construction work...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:23.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take care of the work at Tirol!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:32.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The manager said that it'll be okay as long as I work there from today until Valentine's Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.55,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:34.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:39.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,For the sake of Valentine's Day, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:42.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Work, work, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.02,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:15.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato wants to celebrate Valentine's Day here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.01,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:20.81,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She's such a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:40.60,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:44.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.54,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:49.42,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for working so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be working even harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:56.78,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,I'd love it, but it's about time to close for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:59.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? It's already this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:03.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else I could help out with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:08.26,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,There are only two days left until Valentine's Day. You've already done your share!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:12.22,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,Could you bring in the signboard from outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:14.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.82,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:37.40,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,We landed funny again, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:42.01,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,At least we didn't land in the sea this time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:44.98,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,You nearly killed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:46.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.00,Default,Makona,0000,0000,0000,,A girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.85,Default,Makona,0000,0000,0000,,There are humans in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:02.58,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:07.34,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know if this is a world where white, meat bun-like things can speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:08.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:13.65,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Um... this person's name is Kurogane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:19.10,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Fai, and this is Syaoran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:21.02,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,And that makes this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:23.00,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:26.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:29.28,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.35,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:38.28,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Mokona, it's all right for you to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:40.79,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,This girl won't be surprised, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:45.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nope! Ioryogi is also a speaking stuffed animal, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:47.49,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:48.79,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.35,0:08:51.04,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How long do you plan on lollygagging around for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:53.45,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The manager's gonna be worried—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:55.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.02,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,So you're called Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:03.21,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Mokona.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.03,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:08.15,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, it's you! The one from the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So all of you are traveling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:37.26,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:38.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The four of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:40.52,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Three people and one Mokona!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:41.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,One Mokona?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.54,0:09:43.19,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,It's how you count Mokona!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:47.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Which means that... Ioryogi, you would be one Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:50.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:55.06,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Mr. Kuro's and Ioryogi's voices really do sound alike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:56.33,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,No, we don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:58.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.41,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:11.92,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,The Kurogane of this world is little and blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.83,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell, you meat bun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:19.76,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,You! Don't think you can get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:17.50,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then you've come here as part of your travels?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:18.84,Default Alt,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:21.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I've read about traveling in a book!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.21,0:10:24.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's when you stop at all sorts of different places, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:26.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Have you already decided where you're going to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:28.64,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:32.72,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if we had somewhere to stay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.61,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have any of this world's currency, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.27,0:10:36.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You... don't have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:39.99,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,The money we have now probably won't work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:42.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's difficult, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:47.83,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we don't have a girl with us, so camping out is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:49.79,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Mokona's the only girl in the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:51.86,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:52.78,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,By color?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:54.24,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,By cuteness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:58.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you're in a pinch...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you stay over at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.34,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:05.84,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:08.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay! I have a room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:10.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I only have one futon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But if we all huddle together and sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:16.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, but there are bigger people here too...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:20.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, but if split up the part that you lay on and the part that you cover yourself with!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:23.44,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,One futon is for one person?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I sleep with Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:27.81,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Then, in that case—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really, it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:32.64,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Then we'll take you up on that, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:34.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Hanato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.04,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:37.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:42.18,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what happens, Ioryogi will protect you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.54,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:49.91,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Alrighty then, let's all go to Kobato's place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:50.87,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:52.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.14,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:58.73,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.67,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he has some sort of plan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.67,0:12:06.01,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro-tan, why are you frowning?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:06.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.19,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, wrong one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:14.71,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,I take that back. That idiot \Nprobably isn't thinking of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:18.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:24.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery's on break, but I need to be at Tirol this morning or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:26.78,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,We tried to wake you up many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.68,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,You were sleeping so soundly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:32.52,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who you sleep with doesn't matter at all, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:39.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! I need to leave now, but please feel free to use the room as you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:42.93,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you're going to a pastry shop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:44.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! To help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:49.81,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,To... get ingredients for making chocolate on Valentine's Day, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:50.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:54.38,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Then we'll help out too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:58.54,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,That's a good idea! So we can repay you for letting us stay over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:00.71,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Then who should go to the store...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:03.54,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran, why don't you go with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:09.77,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,You're good at cooking, and Mr. Kuro working in a pastry shop is a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:11.42,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:16.14,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro-tan and I will find another job in order to earn some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:19.17,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,And you, Mokona?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:20.93,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,I'll stay here with Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.01,0:13:22.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:25.18,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Because I just feel so close to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:27.28,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not feeling it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:30.92,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,All right then. Let's leave it at that. Everyone, do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:32.15,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:34.20,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:36.67,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best to play with someone just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,We're not alike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:40.38,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,But Ioryogi, you're jealous of Mokona's cuteness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:41.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.59,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi, who's that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:50.06,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I think he's a friend of Kobato's, or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:57.77,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Mokona's good at pretending to be a stuffed animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:14:00.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Quit talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:05.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you're amazing! Syaoran, you're really talented!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.08,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Once you get used to it, it's easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:11.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how many times I practice, I just can't manage to wrap them up prettily...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.36,0:14:16.10,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Don't try to put everything in at once. Try it like this, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,One at a time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:38.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, no singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:44.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran, you've all been traveling for a long time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:48.93,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. But it's not a journey with a specific destination in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:50.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:54.88,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,It's a journey wherein continuously traveling itself is the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:06.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... then you haven't yet decided on the destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:09.22,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,It's rather hard to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:13.43,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,We don't even know how long we can stay in one place and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.97,0:15:20.53,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,there's someone waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:28.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Someone waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:33.78,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been waiting for me, even though I'm unsure when I can return again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:42.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There's a place I want to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A place that I want to arrive at no matter what...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:51.00,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Is that because there's meaning in traveling to that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:56.30,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Or is it because if you go to that place, you'll be able to meet with the person you've longed to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.71,0:16:00.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The person I've longed to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:52.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The person I want to meet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:02.30,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,We sure worked a lot, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:04.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You just sat there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:04.16,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You just sat there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:06.72,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Right, as Signboard Mokona!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:07.71,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What on Earth is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:09.47,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.47,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,How was working at the pastry shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:14.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:19.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Syaoran is very talented and even the manager praised him over and over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:20.03,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:23.52,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Though, the manager also said that he was wearing rather unusual clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:27.27,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the clothes got you? They were a problem for us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:29.92,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,People asked us if we were cosplaying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:36.03,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,Things got complicated because you kept asking if such outfits would be considered as cosplay in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.23,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:42.88,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,It's only from one day of work so it's not a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:45.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure? Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:48.82,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. It'd make me very happy if you'd take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:50.68,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,As payment for letting us stay here and all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:53.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:56.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll use it for Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:01.24,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.71,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,When this earring shines, we have no \Nchoice but to travel on to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:16.51,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for letting us stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:19.91,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,We were only here for two days, but it was a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:21.72,Default,Kurogane,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:26.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, I'm sorry I wasn't able to really help you out very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:29.19,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, about Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:33.79,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:39.17,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,But she seems to be rather unsure about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:40.38,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's such a pretty glow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:43.10,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it? It's Mokona's favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:48.25,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,People from other worlds can't do more than simply watch over her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:49.61,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,but please include us in that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:52.02,Default,Fai,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:54.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:31.31,Default,Syaoran,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be great if you could get there, to the place you want to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.43,0:19:34.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:55.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Those people were...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:57.98,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,From a different world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:02.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There are more worlds than just this human one, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:09.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There's the heavenly world, the underworld, the spirit world... and probably even more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:22.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I hope that their next world will be the one where their precious person is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:41.34,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,They all look like they're having a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.05,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:48.46,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato really worked hard for this, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:50.63,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well... yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.03,0:20:57.27,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, that's a funny looking shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:20:59.81,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:02.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was supposed to be a star, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.42,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,You sure it's not a starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:06.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Do you think it's a starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:10.83,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,And not just chocolate... she gave me money too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:16.12,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She even prepared the wrapping paper and cards to go along with the chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:20.36,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I hope she's not working herself too hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:28.30,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Yoshio, who are you giving your chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.30,0:21:31.27,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,To my mommy and daddy, and to my little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:36.32,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm giving it to my mommy too! And... I can give one to you too, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:44.05,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,You have to give your best chocolate to the person you like best on Valentine's Day, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.05,0:21:47.45,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, who are you giving your best chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:49.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:17.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She better be saving some for me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:35.02,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:46.98,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:53.57,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There really isn't much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:32.90,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:40.57,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:35.75,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:40.34,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:44.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.15,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:54.49,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:02:00.07,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.86,0:02:03.91,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:07.45,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.70,0:02:10.51,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:13.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:18.50,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:21.31,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:24.90,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:27.66,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:30.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:37.28,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:41.29,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.94,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
