Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:55.19,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\fs20\pos(364,364)\bord0\c&H33322F&\be1\blur4}Production\N{\fs25}The Kobato Protection Group
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.87,0:02:55.19,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\fs20\bord1.2\pos(360,360)\3c&H33322F&}Production\N{\fs25}The Kobato Protection Group
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:03:01.24,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(365,195)\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}...The Traveler.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.75,0:03:01.24,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(360,190)\bord1.6}...The Traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.23,0:23:12.23,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}Your smile falls in that space
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:20.49,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}between the things I've lost and the things I've gained.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.68,0:23:26.49,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}It seems as if I could reach it, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:31.94,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}It's not as if I can fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:38.54,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}Even though I only wanted to make you smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:49.49,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}What purpose do they serve, these useless wings of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:24:00.47,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}All I can do is smile by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.11,0:24:07.52,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}I wonder if it's okay to only warm your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.60,0:24:12.34,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}when, at the very least, I want to envelop you in warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.76,0:24:19.83,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}Have you noticed? I want to embrace you with my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.63,0:24:27.97,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\be1\org(0,0)}And now, I am able to smile.
